1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,340
Now this one's for the fathers, the ones who showed us how

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:07,780
To stand in front of those we love, and I can see them now

3
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:11,860
They worked from dark to dark and never once went asking for the praise

4
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:15,700
And they held the roof above our heads through all the leanest days

5
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:19,380
They taught us that a real man is the shelter, not the storm

6
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:23,300
He's the one out in the cold so the ones he loves stay warm

7
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,980
So here's to all the fathers, those beside us and those gone

8
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:30,980
Every one of them still with us in the way we carry on

9
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:34,340
Raise whatever suits you, be it whiskey, be it water

10
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:38,500
Here's to all the ones we're missing, every son and every daughter

11
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,860
Oh, they're never gone while we're reminiscing

12
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,700
There's a seat for 'em at the table

13
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:49,300
So we'll sing for 'em together for as long as we are able
